@startuml
title Administrator Merchant Account Management — Sequence DRAFT
actor Administrator
participant "Administration System" as AdminUI
participant "Ordering System" as System
participant "Merchant Accounts" as Accounts

Administrator -> AdminUI: Sign in
Administrator -> AdminUI: Add merchant from basic information
AdminUI -> System: Create merchant account
System -> Accounts: Save merchant account
Accounts --> System: Account created
System --> AdminUI: Provide account credentials for merchant

Administrator -> AdminUI: Edit or deactivate merchant
AdminUI -> System: Update merchant account
System -> Accounts: Save merchant state
Accounts --> System: Updated merchant
System --> AdminUI: Show result

Administrator -> AdminUI: Add administrator account
AdminUI -> System: Create administrator account
System -> Accounts: Save administrator account
Accounts --> System: Account created
System --> AdminUI: Show result

note over Administrator,Accounts
  Requirements: FR-02, FR-03–FR-05, FR-22, FR-26, FR-32
  Merchant basic-information fields remain Unconfirmed.
end note
@enduml
